                    "propertyValues": {
                        "html": {
                            "type": "TRANSLATION_LITERAL",
                            "value": {
                                "code": null,
                                "comment": "",
                                "message": "<p data-end=\"573\" data-start=\"286\">SMS OTP-based MFA is a security method that requires users to enter a one-time passcode (OTP) sent via text message (SMS) to their registered mobile number after entering their password. This adds an extra layer of protection by confirming the user's identity before granting access.</p>\n<blockquote data-end=\"723\" data-start=\"575\">\n<p data-end=\"723\" data-start=\"577\"><strong>Note</strong>: SMS OTP-based MFA is not enabled by default on the ServiceNow platform. To enable it, refer to the official <a href=\"/api/now/v1/context_doc_url/mfa-with-sms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">product documentation</a>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h4 data-end=\"747\" data-start=\"725\"><strong>How It Works</strong>:</h4>\n<ol>\n<li data-end=\"747\" data-start=\"725\">The user logs in with their username and password.</li>\n<li data-end=\"747\" data-start=\"725\">A one-time passcode is sent to their mobile phone via SMS.</li>\n<li data-end=\"747\" data-start=\"725\">The user enters the code to complete authentication.</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 data-end=\"939\" data-start=\"925\"><strong>Advantages</strong>:</h4>\n<ul>\n<li data-end=\"939\" data-start=\"925\">Simple and familiar for most users.</li>\n<li data-end=\"939\" data-start=\"925\">Works on any mobile device - no special app required.</li>\n<li data-end=\"939\" data-start=\"925\">Does not require an internet connection.</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-end=\"1487\" data-start=\"1289\">On the ServiceNow platform, the SMS OTP factor can be selectively applied to user groups based on MFA Factor Policies.<br data-end=\"1418\" data-start=\"1415\">For configuration steps, please refer to the <a href=\"/api/now/v1/context_doc_url/mfa-with-sms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">product documentation</a>.</p>"
                            }
                        }
                    },
